      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWIFT ARIEL (3) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a nose win at this track in a handy 19.73. Has a low draw and likes the trip. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. In form and can go on with it. HURRICANE ETHICS (1) has a strong winning strike-rate here with two wins and a placing from five tries. Was out of placings last time (20.31) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 7 lengths. Can feature in the finish. BEAR MAN (2) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 340m behind Cookie Man (20.21) in a NG. Can figure in the finish. QUEEN GOUT (8) is a course and distance winner who must be considered.",
